// Title: Potential Process Hollowing Activity
// ID: c4b890e5-8d8c-4496-8c66-c805753817cd
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Christopher Peacock '@securepeacock', SCYTHE '@scythe_io', Sittikorn S
// Date: 2022-01-25
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.stealth, attack.t1055.012
// Description: Detects when a memory process image does not match the disk image, indicative of process hollowing.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(Type = "Image is replaced")) AND NOT (((where(Image ICONTAINS ":\\Program Files (x86)") OR where(Image ICONTAINS ":\\Program Files\\") OR where(Image ICONTAINS ":\\Windows\\System32\\wbem\\WMIADAP.exe") OR where(Image ICONTAINS ":\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\wbem\\WMIADAP.exe")))) AND NOT (((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\WindowsApps\\MicrosoftEdge.exe")) OR (where(Image ICONTAINS "\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\Opera\\") AND where(Image IENDSWITH "\\opera.exe")))))
